{"kind":"daily","key":"2026-10-26","issueNumber":17,"title":"学术日报 · 2026-10-26","generatedAt":"2026-10-26T01:25:07.949Z","lead":{"title":"神秘蘑菇引发小人幻觉：DNA测序揭示未知致幻物质","leadParagraph":"研究人员通过DNA测序确认Lanmaoa asiatica是引发小人幻觉的蘑菇，未发现已知致幻物质，可能揭示新的致幻机制。"},"leadItemId":"afoi97k3qgzkv6xzo0p73ztvb","overview":null,"highlights":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/4577dd08a5fd432879b42140a0df09405cef17d1a76f5b4656a9ac72c93e1e7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/f549fcb1d0db09009d5df4d93de9b85d80c1cae2f83084e5494ef8cfc50728ce.webp 48w, /hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/4577dd08a5fd432879b42140a0df09405cef17d1a76f5b4656a9ac72c93e1e7f.webp 96w","itemId":"c2zg2cgqpnca6x705pavy363h","title":"概率论中的核积分与Kleisli提升：同一操作的不同视角","summary":"文章解释了核积分、Kleisli提升和混合分布之间的关系，通过实例说明这些概念在概率论中的应用。核积分是前推和混合的组合，Kleisli提升是这一组合的名称。","sourceName":"科学网博客","sourceUrl":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3582667&do=blog&id=1558065","publishedAt":"2026-10-23T23:07:57.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/bc515405eef0819dba7953a740e698c1e3de3324241b33997d38f154c3d3aa55.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/161ccbabfd58db0dfa44e16247e623a9c9b24eb5a0b82234f28ae315171f66be.webp 48w, /hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/bc515405eef0819dba7953a740e698c1e3de3324241b33997d38f154c3d3aa55.webp 96w","itemId":"l1ssyffosqh6orn58gumwn9r4","title":"科学家发现胰腺癌如何重写其 DNA 以逃避治疗","summary":"研究团队通过分析 443,451 个胰腺癌细胞，发现 MYC 基因在最具有侵略性的癌细胞中高度活跃。阻断 MYC 活性可使癌细胞恢复为较不具侵略性的状态，提高免疫细胞识别癌细胞的能力。研究还揭示了 TIGIT 基因活性增加和 PD1 基因活性降低的组合可能帮助胰腺癌逃避免疫检测。","sourceName":"ScienceDaily 综合","sourceUrl":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/10/261024221849.htm","publishedAt":"2026-10-25T11:00:25.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"人类海马体CA1区的前向再激活支持重复学习并在衰老过程中保持不变","summary":"研究使用高分辨率功能性MRI和表征相似性分析，在418名年龄从36岁到100岁的参与者中，发现海马体CA1区在重复编码过程中自发预测了即将出现的状态，这种前向再激活在重复学习中起关键作用，并且在衰老过程中保持不变。","sourceName":"bioRxiv","sourceUrl":"https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.64898/2026.10.20.760541v1?rss=1","publishedAt":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"p8a10me4jux593i4opftln8v9"}],"sections":[{"label":"AI 与计算","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/4577dd08a5fd432879b42140a0df09405cef17d1a76f5b4656a9ac72c93e1e7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/f549fcb1d0db09009d5df4d93de9b85d80c1cae2f83084e5494ef8cfc50728ce.webp 48w, /hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/4577dd08a5fd432879b42140a0df09405cef17d1a76f5b4656a9ac72c93e1e7f.webp 96w","itemId":"c2zg2cgqpnca6x705pavy363h","title":"概率论中的核积分与Kleisli提升：同一操作的不同视角","summary":"文章解释了核积分、Kleisli提升和混合分布之间的关系，通过实例说明这些概念在概率论中的应用。核积分是前推和混合的组合，Kleisli提升是这一组合的名称。","sourceName":"科学网博客","sourceUrl":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3582667&do=blog&id=1558065","publishedAt":"2026-10-23T23:07:57.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]},{"label":"生命与医学","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/bc515405eef0819dba7953a740e698c1e3de3324241b33997d38f154c3d3aa55.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/161ccbabfd58db0dfa44e16247e623a9c9b24eb5a0b82234f28ae315171f66be.webp 48w, /hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/bc515405eef0819dba7953a740e698c1e3de3324241b33997d38f154c3d3aa55.webp 96w","itemId":"afoi97k3qgzkv6xzo0p73ztvb","title":"神秘蘑菇引发小人幻觉：DNA测序揭示未知致幻物质","summary":"研究人员通过DNA测序确认Lanmaoa asiatica是引发小人幻觉的蘑菇，未发现已知致幻物质，可能揭示新的致幻机制。","sourceName":"ScienceDaily 综合","sourceUrl":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/10/261024222021.htm","publishedAt":"2026-10-25T06:36:10.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/bc515405eef0819dba7953a740e698c1e3de3324241b33997d38f154c3d3aa55.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/161ccbabfd58db0dfa44e16247e623a9c9b24eb5a0b82234f28ae315171f66be.webp 48w, /hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/bc515405eef0819dba7953a740e698c1e3de332